The system will support an **Account Registration Request** process.

A registration request contains:

* Reference Code
* First Name
* Middle Name
* Last Name
* Username
* Position Title
* Requested Role
* Applicant Remarks
* Password Hash
* Status
* Review Remarks
* Assigned Role
* Reviewer
* Review Date
* Created At
* Updated At

## Registration Workflow

The registration request can have the following statuses:

* Pending
* Approved
* Rejected

An authorized user can review the registration request and:

* Approve
* Reject
* Add review remarks
* Assign the final role

Once approved, the system can create the actual user account.

